{"id":"n93472-1-6","stage":4,"title":"왕따 · 排挤","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93472-1-6-1","ko":"쟤는 왜 혼자 놀고 있지?","zh":"他为什么一个人在玩啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쟤는","meaning":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"쟤：“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"쟤","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71213","senseId":"1","lemma":"쟤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀고","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"07345a466b2427d0","term":"쟤","zh":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/07345a466b2427d03046.mp3","entryId":"71213","definition":"“저 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8769f502195bba7ce273.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93472-1-6-2","ko":"아무래도 저 반에 왕따가 있는 것 같아.","zh":"看来那个班里有被孤立的人呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반에","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왕따가","meaning":"排挤，孤立，疏远，受气包，局外人","explanation":"왕따：排挤，孤立，疏远，受气包，局外人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"왕따","audio":"/audio/3caefc78babcf8fc084c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93472","senseId":"1","lemma":"왕따","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"3caefc78babcf8fc","term":"왕따","zh":"排挤，孤立，疏远，受气包，局外人","audio":"/audio/3caefc78babcf8fc084c.mp3","entryId":"93472","definition":"把讨厌或不喜欢的人单列出来，对其疏远或刁难；或指被排斥的人。","pronunciation":["왕따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f6b0ae57cd230a7a9bb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.79,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=93472","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.6167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他为什么一个人在玩啊？","看来那个班里有被孤立的人呢。","火快熄灭了，越来越冷了呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他为什么一个人在玩啊？","看来那个班里有被孤立的人呢。","火快熄灭了，越来越冷了呢。"],"answer":1}]}
